<title>SPAIN: Spain will not publish Sept jobless data Thursday.</title>
<headline>Spain will not publish Sept jobless data Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry said on Thursday that it would not publish today data on Spanish unemployment in September.</p>
<p>The Ministry added that the data might be published on Friday.</p>
<p>In August, unemployment declined by 27,000 people to a rate of 13.50 percent.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 585 2167</p>
</text>
